{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"ab069664-365a-45b9-b7aa-1589b02250a1","step":{"id":"s1","script":"A vector shows both direction and size. Start by drawing vector a: three units to the right.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Adding vectors: head to tail"},{"op":"figure","id":"vectors","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-0.6,4.1],"y":[-0.7,3.1],"axes":"none","equal_scale":true},"marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"start","at":[0,0],"label":"O"},{"kind":"point","id":"join","at":[3,0],"label":"P"},{"kind":"segment","id":"veca","from":{"at":"start"},"to":{"at":"join"},"arrow":true,"label":"a"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"aval","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"\\vec a=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"ab069664-365a-45b9-b7aa-1589b02250a1","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Place vector b's tail at a's head. Here b points two units upward. Moving a vector without turning or stretching preserves it.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"addb","on":"vectors","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"finish","at":[3,2],"label":"Q"},{"kind":"segment","id":"vecb","from":{"at":"join"},"to":{"at":"finish"},"arrow":true,"label":"b"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"bval","anchor":{"el":"aval","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"\\vec b=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"ab069664-365a-45b9-b7aa-1589b02250a1","step":{"id":"s3","script":"The sum is one arrow from the first tail to the last head. It represents the same overall displacement as both arrows together.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"sumarrow","on":"vectors","marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"resultant","from":{"at":"start"},"to":{"at":"finish"},"arrow":true,"label":"a + b"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"sumval","anchor":{"el":"bval","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"\\vec a+\\vec b=\\begin{pmatrix}3+0\\\\0+2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"Which points are the tail and head of the resultant vector?","expected_gist":"Tail at O, head at Q."}}}
